{
  "id": "rare_mere_moth_queen",
  "name": "The Mere Moth Queen",
  "tier": "rare",
  "zone": "coldwater",
  "body": "carrion_moth",
  "place": "drifts over the reed beds of Coldwater Mere at dusk with a cloud of her children",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). A moth as wide as a door. Her wing dust leaves weakening clouds, she dives at players in a line, and at half health she calls her swarm and blinds the field: dust everywhere except under the lamps she lights — circles of safe light that move.",
  "party": {
    "solo": "Solo-able (the light follows you).",
    "small": "Easy.",
    "full": "Easy.",
    "m5": "M5 adds health per extra player and one more copy of the spread/scatter shapes for parties of 4-5; mechanics stay the same."
  },
  "hpMult": 1.7,
  "arena": {
