      "A cloud of pale wings rises from the reeds. In the middle, one huge pair.",
      "Dust like pollen settles on everything."
    ],
    "death": "The Moth Queen spirals down into the reeds. The swarm scatters.",
    "reset": "The Queen flutters back over the reeds."
  },
  "abilities": {
